 "notes": "Answers come from the endpoint the invoice screen calls, so session.php, db_conn.php and functions.php all ran. Numbers are the exact strings the endpoint returned. Rounding rule: every line is number_format-ed to 2dp, then tax is accumulated line by line with the accumulator rounded at every step, so per-line and total-level rounding differ on purpose and the rebuild must match the accumulated form. A manual tax override only survives when fld_subtotal_amount still equals the computed subtotal. A special-order line whose qty is <= -99999 is dropped silently.",
 "fixture_file_date": "2026-11-11",
